ri în Slatina și Olt", "header_size": "h1", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=primary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_element_id": "hero-titlu"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zolt003", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Oltul e un județ îngust și lung, croit pe cursul inferior al râului care îi dă numele. Slatina stă în nord, Caracalul la mijloc, iar la Corabia județul atinge Dunărea. Între primul și ultimul capăt sunt mai mulți kilometri decât pare, și toți pe aceeași direcție.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}selector{max-width:672px !important}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=quote"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zolt004", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 mb-8\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-on-surface-variant\">Pachete pentru Olt, de la</span>\n<p class=\"font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface leading-none\">4.800 €</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl\">Peste grilă se pune transportul, 6 lei/km dus-întors, calculat pe localitate: până la Slatina drumul e sensibil mai scurt decât până la Corabia.</p>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zolt005", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\">\n<a class=\"inline-block text-center whitespace-nowrap bg-accent text-white px-8 md:px-10 py-4 uppercase font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"https://wa.me/40722911485?text=Bun%C4%83%20ziua%21%20Organizez%20un%20eveniment%20%C3%AEn%20jude%C8%9Bul%20Olt%20%C8%99i%20a%C8%99%20dori%20s%C4%83%20verific%20disponibilitatea.\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Verifică data pe WhatsApp</a>\n<a class=\"btn-secundar-zona inline-block text-center whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface bg-transparent px-8 md:px-10 py-4 uppercase font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"tel:+40722911485\">+40 722 911 485</a>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zolt006", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><span class=\"ph\">Imagine provizorie — se înlocuiește cu fotografie din județul Olt (peisaj, min. 1440 px lățime, subiect în treimea centrală)</span></p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "zolt007", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"motif-separator w-24 md:w-36 mt-10\"></div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false